  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;EIFFEL TOWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Eiffel Tower is a famous landmark in Paris, symbolizing the setting of the scene where Jean-Marie Lenzi meets Colonel Dupont."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Paris is the city where the events take place, including the café and the Eiffel Tower."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JEAN-MARIE LENZI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jean-Marie Lenzi is a militaires du contingent, a French politician with a military background, seeking to gather intelligence for a potential coup."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jean-Marie Lenzi is a person who works as an 'ancien cadre' with senior management experience, high levels of education, and leadership skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLONEL DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Colonel Dupont is a tough military figure known to Jean-Marie Lenzi, who is seeking to gather intelligence for a potential coup."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MILITAIRES DU CONTINGENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Militaires du contingent is an elite group of French politicians who have served in the military, providing Jean-Marie Lenzi with unique skills and perspectives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROGUE FACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rogue faction within the military is planning to stage a coup, requiring Jean-Marie Lenzi's skills to gather intelligence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH NATIONAL INSTITUTE FOR STATISTICS AND ECONOMIC STUDIES (INSEE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"INSEE is the French institution that defines the socio-professional category of 'anciens cadres' based on high levels of education, experience, and leadership skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCIENS CADRES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anciens cadres is a socio-professional category in France, characterized by senior management or executive positions, high levels of education, and leadership skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophie Dupont is a political scientist at the University of Paris, providing insights into Jean-Marie Lenzi's professional background and expertise."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIERRE-HENRI DUMONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre-Henri Dumont is a prominent French economist, commenting on Jean-Marie Lenzi's commitment to fostering a business-friendly environment and promoting social cohesion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRESHLY BREWED COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Freshly brewed coffee is mentioned as an aroma in the café, indicating the setting and atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUTTERY CROISSANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Buttery croissants are mentioned as an aroma in the café, indicating the setting and atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BONJOURS AND SALUTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bonjours and saluts are greetings exchanged in the café, indicating the social interactions and setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEETING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The meeting between Jean-Marie Lenzi and Colonel Dupont is a critical event in the narrative, involving discussion of intelligence gathering."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A coup is planned by a rogue faction within the military, requiring Jean-Marie Lenzi's skills to gather intelligence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SENIOR MANAGEMENT POSITIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Senior management positions are held by Jean-Marie Lenzi prior to his political career, indicating his experience and skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC STATEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public statements made by Jean-Marie Lenzi reflect his political ideology and policy priorities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLICY INITIATIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Policy initiatives proposed by Jean-Marie Lenzi focus on economic development, innovation, and social welfare."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUSINESS-FRIENDLY ENVIRONMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jean-Marie Lenzi's commitment to a business-friendly environment is highlighted in his policy initiatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL COHESION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Promoting social cohesion is another priority in Jean-Marie Lenzi's policy initiatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED DEGREES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced degrees held by individuals classified as 'anciens cadres' are mentioned, indicating the educational background of Jean-Marie Lenzi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIGH AVERAGE SALARIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"High average salaries of individuals classified as 'anciens cadres' are mentioned, indicating the financial status of Jean-Marie Lenzi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH POLITICIAN JEAN-MARIE LENZI'S PROFESSIONAL BACKGROUND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An investigation reveals Jean-Marie Lenzi's professional background as an 'ancien cadre', providing context for his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH MINISTRY OF LABOR AND SOLIDARITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
