      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCIEN CADRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancien cadre is a socio-professional category characterized by senior management experience, high levels of education, and leadership skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLITICAL IDEOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Political ideology refers to the beliefs and principles held by Jean-Marie Lenzi that shape his approach to governance and policy-making."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLICY PRIORITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Policy priorities refer to the specific areas of focus and goals that Jean-Marie Lenzi aims to address through his policies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC POLICY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public policy refers to the policies and actions taken by government bodies to address societal issues, which are influenced by Jean-Marie Lenzi's professional background and ideology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0142</data>
    </node>
